Nice bar with good choice of Belgium beer
Feb 2025 • Couples
We have been here several times;
This place has several floors with gorgeous balconies;
The selection of Belgian beers is amazing - there's a bit of everything here at reasonable prices;
The service is top notch and the staff speak good English.
Written February 14, 2025
